:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Baby Mola (Super Rare Cat)]].''
'''Young Man Mola''' (厨房マンボウ, ''Chūbō Manbō'', '''Kitchen Sunfish''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Survive! Mola Mola! Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 3.5 Update|Version 3.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Young Man Mola
|image = E 150.png
|appearance = [[Survive! Mola Mola! Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 30¢ - 118¢
}}

==Enemy==
An easy enemy, that nevertheless deals quite significant damage when piled up. He has the same range as [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]], but only has 1 HP, therefore immediately dying upon contact.

